<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips Q1 regional revenues and income.</title>
<headline>Philips Q1 regional revenues and income.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips revenues and income from operations by geographical region first quarter 1997 in millions of guilders:</p>
<p>REVENUES -----</p>
<p>    Europe				14,842  vs  14,486</p>
<p>    USA and Canada		     3,921  vs   3,402</p>
<p>    Latin America			1,074  vs     889</p>
<p>    Africa				    59  vs	70</p>
<p>    Asia Pacific			 5,766  vs   4,848</p>
<p>    Interregional sales	debit 9,526  vs   8,064 debit</p>
<p>    TOTAL THIRD PARTY SALES	 16,136  vs  15,631</p>
<p>INCOME FROM OPERATIONS -----</p>
<p>    Europe				   481  vs     291</p>
<p>    USA and Canada		 loss    5  vs	15 profit</p>
<p>    Latin America			   43  vs	25</p>
<p>    Africa			   loss    1  vs	 3 profit</p>
<p>    Asia Pacific			   318  vs     356</p>
<p>    TOTAL				    836  vs     690</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
